7.1 Prepare the Data
The response is centred, and the predictors are supplied as a matrix:

y &lt;- sw |&gt;
  select(Y) |&gt;
  scale(center = TRUE, scale = FALSE) |&gt;
  as.matrix()

X &lt;- sw |&gt;
  select(-X, -dist, -bio, -Y, -Y1, -Y2) |&gt;
